      "verificationMethod": "direct-http-body-capture+reviewed-excerpt",
      "excerpt": "THÉRÈSE MARTIN was born at Alençon, France on 2 January 1873. On 9 April 1888 she entered the Carmel of Lisieux. She was canonized by Pope Pius XI on 17 May 1925.",
      "excerptSha256": "60c17eb515df8167999de1b10f5565d6e4cd85aa661c9c77fe4c3adf6dee7b22"
    },
    {
      "id": "therese-lisieux",
      "url": "https://www.therese-de-lisieux.catholique.fr/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/Press-kit.pdf",
      "publisher": "Sanctuary of Lisieux",
      "publisherHost": "www.therese-de-lisieux.catholique.fr",
      "status": 200,
      "contentType": "application/pdf",
      "bytesRead": 1017112,
      "sha256": "933cc3e9eb3a768bf4d55443cd73be3c86899fcf688d338a47e062793d7b470e",
      "verificationMethod": "direct-http-body-capture+reviewed-excerpt",
      "excerpt": "Thérèse of Lisieux, known throughout the world, was born Thérèse Martin on 2 January 1873 in Alençon and died on 30 September 1897 in the Carmelite convent in Lisieux, where she was a nun for nine years. Her seminal work is Histoire d'une Âme, or Autobiographical Manuscripts, published a year after her death.",
      "excerptSha256": "5ce4f17e36b04dd599f6250e36d02333e199ef4952505c94fc57fda6a6d48210"
    },
    {
      "id": "clausius-deutsche",
